@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Identity and Git acceptance journeys
actor "Repository owner" as Owner
actor "Non-owner or visitor" as Other
participant "Browser / API" as API
participant "Git client" as Client
participant "GitForge transport and policies" as Transport
database "Test metadata and bare repository" as State
Owner -> API : Register / sign in / create repository
API -> State : Create test identity and metadata
Owner -> API : Issue disposable PAT
API --> Owner : Show new secret once
Owner -> Client : Clone, commit, push, fetch
Client -> Transport : PAT-authenticated Smart HTTP
Transport -> State : Authorized Git operations
Owner -> API : Verify branch, commit and file content
Other -> API : Attempt private access or owner-only mutation
API --> Other : Reject or conceal according to policy
Owner -> API : Revoke test PAT
Client -> Transport : Retry revoked credentials
Transport --> Client : Reject authentication
@enduml
